      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just to clarify, \n\nthis issue not happen if only install Windows patch.\n\nIf you enable, Kernel-mode Hardware-enforced Stack Protection, this issue happen.\n\n(Kernel-mode Hardware-enforced Stack Protection is a kernel mode attack mitigation, so disabling this will degrade the security of your system)\n\nAnyway, need to fix.",
